          "settings": {
            "heading": "How the evidence gets handled",
            "body": "<p>I review published research. I don't run studies, so the copy on this site credits the researchers, and it makes no clinical claims.</p><p>Every ingredient has its own page, setting out what it does, how strong the evidence is, and the references behind it. My reasoning is there to be checked.</p><p>If you email, I read it and I reply.</p>",
