        "band_coast": {
          "type": "narrative",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The coast",
            "body": "<p>Biotaderm is made in Welcombe, a small village right on the line where Devon meets Cornwall, with the Atlantic just below it. The coast shapes how the brand looks and feels, and it shows up in one ingredient.</p><p>Bladderwrack is the same Atlantic seaweed that grows on the rocks below the village. You will have stepped over it. Ours reaches us as a cold oil infusion of that same species, made in the UK without heat or solvents. So the link to the coast is the species itself.</p>",
